section.animate-in.space-y-4
	h1.text-5xl.font-bold.tracking-tight.leading-none
		GradientText Examples
	p.text-lg.max-w-prose.leading-relaxed(class="text-fg-muted")
		| The same apps written two ways. Same UI, same behavior — different conventions.

section.animate-in-delayed.pt-12.space-y-3
	.grid.gap-3(class="sm:grid-cols-2")
		Card(href="/examples/norns")
			.flex.items-start.justify-between.gap-3.mb-2
				h2.font-semibold.text-lg Norns
				span.text-xs.font-mono.shrink-0.mt-1(class="text-fg-subtle") .n
			p.text-sm.leading-relaxed(class="text-fg-muted") Pug + Civet, the
				code .n
				| extension. Concise, typed, optional.
		Card(href="/examples/svelte")
			.flex.items-start.justify-between.gap-3.mb-2
				h2.font-semibold.text-lg Vanilla Svelte
				span.text-xs.font-mono.shrink-0.mt-1(class="text-fg-subtle") .svelte
			p.text-sm.leading-relaxed(class="text-fg-muted") HTML + TypeScript, the
				code .svelte
				| extension. Default.
		Card(href="/examples/ui" class="sm:col-span-2")
			.flex.items-start.justify-between.gap-3.mb-2
				h2.font-semibold.text-lg norns-ui
				span.text-xs.font-mono.shrink-0.mt-1(class="text-fg-subtle") catalog
			p.text-sm.leading-relaxed(class="text-fg-muted") Every component in
				code @human-synthesis/norns-ui
				| with its variants — buttons, forms, Dialog, Sheet, Popover, Dropdown, Tooltip, Tabs, Toast.
